9", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619677_1633042394401202_7209868863111439645_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7F-pIZFwyMoQ7kNvwEH0wZw&_nc_oc=Adp2uHyYeYnue3ebwWUPrYqkCfl-dbxcoOgIcJ6B3Oy_wh1vqdqxGQST9b8VoI7vd2A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVxd3K8AysXrA8Ciz37pSu-Ia89Mb9cifG-WmWq3O7XRw&oe=6B1033C6"}, {"file_name": "Teeth_2560x1440.png", "id": "917057617855874", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620497_917057624522540_3322054066031636962_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hvWpcPg4GXkQ7kNvwEbI6_1&_nc_oc=Ado68-ODfd__3OQzDTq47r-pHZyvxzKVePwP13f2ff5IZCPsOEAfm3Ko_Bkwsd0JQl8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWBua6FYJbad9d_NZR4AArLp9RkBj6k8F6_DcfdVuPS4w&oe=6B1061E2"}, {"file_name": "Ostertagia.png", "id": "974074545049377", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618882_974074551716043_3982132693816971777_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UpjYeSYhfeQQ7kNvwE2ae79&_nc_oc=AdrHF50WnaYgYp6hIA7DWShXeb36gyD8h4uJ-E55g03kdsN4mHiIjHRQCadf2qqLkR8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWIBwZPrhgZ0dhOa3VQSnuZLwrs0tXvRX2vWZKHWOeHIg&oe=6B105B7A"}, {"file_name": "kidney_glomeruli_2560x1440.png", "id": "1529509712024716", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618885_1529509715358049_3070632166327873331_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LDxapzHeBLsQ7kNvwFyYinO&_nc_oc=AdpIAkW3g-OKSgOFnYyszUe-kMy9By0tFvE0Ry0pHyAoImk_c70anhgJfaQf4qP2AMI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVa7FD7T9w67ayNc1NkqLz6n2QVWveNtEZ6l-MnZbJRzg&oe=6B105291"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "ConfocalVR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "## **ConfocalVR**\n\nImmersive 3D exploration of microscopy image stacks on Meta Quest. Load prepared Z-stacks from confocal, two-photon, electron microscopy, and other volumetric techniques.\n\n## **What it does**\n\n- Render Z-stacks as navigable 3D volumes. Fly through tissue, rotate specimens, and examine structures from any angle.\n- Work with up to 30 channels using brightness, threshold, and opacity controls.\n- Load TIFF, NIfTI, DICOM, PNG, and JPG directly on the headset.\n- Download ZIP files from Google Drive or another web source in Quest Browser, then open them locally in ConfocalVR.\n- Meet colleagues in a shared virtual space.\n- Measure distances, inspect voxel-intensity histograms, and mark or count objects.\n- Play prepared time sequences from separate timepoint files.\n- Adjust transfer functions, brightness, contrast, and clipping planes in real time.\n\n## **Who it\u2019s for**\n\nScientists, educators, and core facility managers working with prepared small-to-mid-sized 3D microscopy datasets. Use ConfocalVR for exploration, teaching, review, and discussion of spatial relationships in a standalone Quest headset.\n\nAutomated segmentation, tracing, tracking, and large-scale quantitative analysis remain in the lab\u2019s established analysis workflow.\n\n## **Larger datasets?**\n\nPrepare reduced or cropped image-slice folders for reliable Quest loading. A Windows desktop version handles up to 128M voxels. See immsci.com/confocalvr.", "short_description": "Make your microscopy visible. ConfocalVR lets you load 3D image stacks on a Quest headset and show your data in true three dimensions \u2014 to colleagues, students, funders, or the public."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.immsci.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Immersive Science LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.immsci.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"